{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "schinese", "appid": 553850, "month": "2026-06", "window": 4, "start_date": 1782259200, "end_date": 1782863999, "month_true_total": 696, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:30:14 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "229268397", "author": {"steamid": "76561199489378008", "personaname": "玄Ⅵ黑Ⅴ柒 fayal", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199489378008/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 7436, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 29, "playtime_at_review": 6461, "last_played": 1788045064, "avatar": "f19e6e24a206e701f35ceb6a28074c2f59de3cdd"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "好玩是真的好玩，箭头不当人也是真的不当人，这款游戏内的债券，如果没有了解过的话，如果选到一个垃圾债券还不想充钱的话，那只能玩垃圾武器了，虽然最近的几个债券性价比都不错，但是超级货币的获取方式实在是太难了，不充值的活需要刷个2-3个小时才可以有一个债券，而且也看运气，我刷了3个小时才攒齐，所以这个游戏我又爱又恨。还有超级公民版可以被成为超级怨种不是没有道理，虽然给的东西不错，但是这个游戏完全有替代品，但是我没有异议，买不买都可以，最后总结，我玩的开心又快乐，但是箭头我谢谢你加强了灭菌器，加强了还是一个样，虽然最近箭头有一点改过自新了，但是在新债券的更新出来之前，我不好说。\n好玩，推荐，但是神人细节和神奇bug以及神奇更新使得这款游戏有着如同赌狗一样的心态，我在赌箭头会把这个游戏做好做爽。", "timestamp_created": 1782847532, "timestamp_updated": 1782847532, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5153350830078125", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32609", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-14700F", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Ti", "vram_size": 16109}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229258546", "author": {"steamid": "76561198362400349", "personaname": "chigga", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198362400349/", "num_games_owned": 127, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 4514, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 196, "playtime_at_review": 2679, "last_played": 1786945128, "avatar": "12a01eaa55c